    },
    {
      "id": "muTFdBRZHr0cu2hnGVPud",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -157.27015212490858,
      "y": 1683.9874929187768,
      "width": 1713.68310546875,
      "height": 1050,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9i5XTDJ04vQe4bdyFMQj1",
      "index": "asV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1762977365,
      "version": 912,
      "versionNonce": 1738919797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1740634851570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "零.人工智能是个黑盒子的原因?\n1.Transparency(开源程度(训练参数,训练过程等))\n2.Interpretable(思维的透明)\n3.Explainable(可解释原因)\n一.为什么我们需要机器学习的可解释性?\n1.基于解释改进模型\n论断:正确的答案不意味着智能;深度学习网络目前很多无法解释;.Interpretablevs PowerfuL?\nPowerful:有力的\nInterpretable:可解释的\n1.一些模型看上去可解释,e.g.linear model,但是not powerful\n2.DL模型十分powerful,但是难以解释\n3.decision tree:通过提问进行分类学习;但是很深的tree依旧无法解释,很多的tree开销大\n三.模型的可解释性\n>not completejust reasonable\nmake people(your customers your boss yourself)comfortableExplainable ML:Local Explanation Global Explanation\n四.如何实现可解释性?\n1.直接对神经网络的进行分析\n    (I)分析关键Token\n        分析Attention：\n            Removing or modifying the components-->find important decison change绘制颜色丰富的概率分布图\n            Saliency Map-e(loss of an example)对xn(特征向量)绘制黑白的概率分布图Limitation:\n                -Noisy Gradient:\n                Sl:SmoothGrad: Randomly add noises to the input image, get saliency maps ofthe noisy images,and average them.\n                -Gradient Saturation:\n                Sl:Integrated gradient(IG)\n        In-context Learning(加速理解;预估模型能力)\n    (II)分析Embedding的信息(probing技术;投影;使用分类器,TTS(消除音色))\n    (III)语言的\"测谎器\"\n2.直接请大语言模型解释\n> 可能正确,也可能不正确",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "零.人工智能是个黑盒子的原因?\n1.Transparency(开源程度(训练参数,训练过程等))\n2.Interpretable(思维的透明)\n3.Explainable(可解释原因)\n一.为什么我们需要机器学习的可解释性?\n1.基于解释改进模型\n论断:正确的答案不意味着智能;深度学习网络目前很多无法解释;.Interpretablevs PowerfuL?\nPowerful:有力的\nInterpretable:可解释的\n1.一些模型看上去可解释,e.g.linear model,但是not powerful\n2.DL模型十分powerful,但是难以解释\n3.decision tree:通过提问进行分类学习;但是很深的tree依旧无法解释,很多的tree开销大\n三.模型的可解释性\n>not completejust reasonable\nmake people(your customers your boss yourself)comfortableExplainable ML:Local Explanation Global Explanation\n四.如何实现可解释性?\n1.直接对神经网络的进行分析\n    (I)分析关键Token\n        分析Attention：\n            Removing or modifying the components-->find important decison change绘制颜色丰富的概率分布图\n            Saliency Map-e(loss of an example)对xn(特征向量)绘制黑白的概率分布图Limitation:\n                -Noisy Gradient:\n                Sl:SmoothGrad: Randomly add noises to the input image, get saliency maps ofthe noisy images,and average them.\n                -Gradient Saturation:\n                Sl:Integrated gradient(IG)\n        In-context Learning(加速理解;预估模型能力)\n    (II)分析Embedding的信息(probing技术;投影;使用分类器,TTS(消除音色))\n    (III)语言的\"测谎器\"\n2.直接请大语言模型解释\n> 可能正确,也可能不正确",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
