      "text": "第九部分:生成的策略",
      "fontSize": 69.34271238260361,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "第九部分:生成的策略",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KFpSnMHHJ_LGrnVlNhBAY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -54.116395470157954,
      "y": 9577.02850619426,
      "width": 1236.8529433174642,
      "height": 595,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "YC2B7iYR8US9nNf73tDCE",
      "index": "ayl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 679162405,
      "version": 1093,
      "versionNonce": 175482543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1740786863043,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "基本概念:\nGenerative AI(生成式人工智能):生成复杂(无法穷尽)有结构(由基本单位组成)的物件\n文字的基本单位:Token\n图片的基本单位:Pixel----每一个像素有多少颜色取决于BPP(Bit per pixel) \n视频的基本单位:fps(frames per second)\n声音的基本单位:取样点(Sample)\n\n生成策略:\n1. AR(Autoregressive Generation-自回归生成)\n> 文字上很成功，但是图片和声音太大了，速度太慢了\n\n2.NAR(Non-autoregressive Generation)\n> 并行输出-一次性生成所有基本单位--速度快，但是质量下降\n> 引发“multi-modality problem“\n> VAE, GAN, Flow-based Model, and Diffusion Model 都有这样的设计\n\n3.Autoregressive + Non-autoregressive",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "基本概念:\nGenerative AI(生成式人工智能):生成复杂(无法穷尽)有结构(由基本单位组成)的物件\n文字的基本单位:Token\n图片的基本单位:Pixel----每一个像素有多少颜色取决于BPP(Bit per pixel) \n视频的基本单位:fps(frames per second)\n声音的基本单位:取样点(Sample)\n\n生成策略:\n1. AR(Autoregressive Generation-自回归生成)\n> 文字上很成功，但是图片和声音太大了，速度太慢了\n\n2.NAR(Non-autoregressive Generation)\n> 并行输出-一次性生成所有基本单位--速度快，但是质量下降\n> 引发“multi-modality problem“\n> VAE, GAN, Flow-based Model, and Diffusion Model 都有这样的设计\n\n3.Autoregressive + Non-autoregressive",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
